{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7166522","formula":"C₃₅H₅₅N₉O₁₆","hill":"C35H55N9O16","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":35.0,"H":55.0,"N":9.0,"O":16.0},"names":{"en":"Peptide-T"},"descriptions":{"en":"Peptide T is an HIV entry inhibitor discovered in 1986 by Candace Pert and Michael Ruff, a US neuroscientist and immunologist. Peptide T, and its modified analog Dala1-peptide T-amide (DAPTA), a drug in clinical trials, is a short peptide derived from the HIV envelope protein gp120 which blocks binding and infection of viral strains which use the CCR5 receptor to infect cells. DAPTA was initially administered as a nasal spray, but this formulation was found to be unstable."},"fame":6,"pubchemCid":73352,"mass":857.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]([C@@H](C(=O)N[C@@H]([C@@H](C)O)C(=O)N[C@@H]([C@@H](C)O)C(=O)N[C@@H](CC(=O)N)C(=O)N[C@@H](CC1=CC=C(C=C1)O)C(=O)N[C@@H]([C@@H](C)O)C(=O)O)NC(=O)[C@H](CO)NC(=O)[C@H](C)N)O","inchikey":"IWHCAJPPWOMXNW-LYKMMFCUSA-N","iupac":"(2S,3R)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-4-amino-2-[[(2S,3R)-2-[[(2S,3R)-2-[[(2S,3R)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-aminopropanoyl]amino]-3-hydroxypropanoyl]amino]-3-hydroxybutanoyl]amino]-3-hydroxybutanoyl]amino]-3-hydroxybutanoyl]amino]-4-oxobutanoyl]amino]-3-(4-hydroxyphenyl)propanoyl]amino]-3-hydroxybutanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"73352","atoms":115,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.069,"y":-1.151,"z":-0.562,"el":"C"},{"x":4.461,"y":-1.51,"z":-1.064,"el":"C"},{"x":5.282,"y":-0.333,"z":-1.643,"el":"C"},{"x":5.049,"y":1.005,"z":-0.92,"el":"C"},{"x":5.778,"y":1.388,"z":-0.006,"el":"O"},{"x":3.975,"y":1.738,"z":-1.371,"el":"N"},{"x":3.678,"y":3.087,"z":-0.855,"el":"C"},{"x":4.626,"y":4.159,"z":-1.439,"el":"C"},{"x":4.397,"y":4.467,"z":-2.915,"el":"C"},{"x":4.556,"y":5.359,"z